@* An empty state that is not empty yet. The distinction matters: "nothing here" and "not
   arrived yet" are different messages, and showing the first while the second is true is how a
   reader concludes there is nothing and leaves. *@
<Empty Class="w-[420px]">
    <EmptyHeader>
        <EmptyIcon><Spinner Class="size-5" /></EmptyIcon>
        <EmptyTitle>Fetching your orders</EmptyTitle>
        <EmptyDescription>This usually takes a second or two.</EmptyDescription>
    </EmptyHeader>
</Empty>
